  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Telos -- EOSIO-based high-performance blockchain with 10,000+ TPS, sub-0.5-second block times, feeless native transactions, and an EVM layer (tEVM). Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and tokens. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
